---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Kennesaw Barber Shop">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Legal</p><h1 class="h1">Privacy <span class="it">Policy.</span></h1></div></section>
  <section class="section paper"><div class="wrap prose">
    <p>Last updated November 4, 2026. This policy explains how {business.name} ("we") handles information on this website.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you book on this website we collect your name, phone number, the service and time you pick, and, if you give them, your email and notes. Our hosting provider may also keep standard server logs such as IP address, browser type, and pages visited for security and performance.</p>
    <h2>Booking</h2>
    <p>We use your booking details only to schedule your appointment and contact you about it. When the shop's Square Appointments account is connected, your booking and contact details are also stored in Square so your appointment lands on the shop calendar; Square's privacy policy covers what Square keeps. Booking details are stored on our secure database host. We may send you booking emails. We do not sell your information or use it for unrelated marketing.</p>
    <h2>Calls and email</h2>
    <p>If you call or email us, we use what you share only to respond and serve you. We do not sell your information.</p>
    <h2>Third party links</h2>
    <p>Links to Square, Google Maps, Facebook, and Instagram go to sites with their own policies.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{business.name}, {business.street}, {business.city}, Georgia {business.zip}. Phone <a href={business.phoneHref}>{business.phone}</a>. Email <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a>.</p>
  </div></section>
</Layout>
